  ('Bullet Dotted Notebook Charcoal Edition 7', 33, 'https://trae-api-cn.mchost.guru/api/ide/v1/text_to_image?prompt=bullet%20dotted%20notebook%20charcoal%20edition%207%2C%20on%20a%20wooden%20desk%2C%20warm%20light%2C%20flat%20lay%20editorial%20photography&image_size=landscape_4_3', 'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Bullet%20Dotted%20Notebook%20Charcoal%20Edition%207', NULL, ARRAY['for-friends']::text[], ARRAY['wedding','newyear']::text[], 'mid', '120gsm paper, no bleed-through. The system that actually sticks.', 'Dots instead of lines. Freedom to plan, sketch, and note in one place.'),
